       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-EDO22-LISS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-EDO22-LISS-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MICROTONE-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-QUATERNION-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MOTZKIN-ARITHMETIC-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LISSAJOUS-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LISSAJOUS-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-EDO22-LISS-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PEL-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PEL-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MICRO-AND-QUAT.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MOTZKIN-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PEL-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MICRO-AND-QUAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MICROTONE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-QUATERNION-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MOTZKIN-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOTZKIN-ARITHMETIC-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LISSAJOUS-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PEL-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MICROTONE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-QUATERNION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MOTZKIN-ARITHMETIC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LISSAJOUS-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-LISSAJOUS-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PEL-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PEL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PEL-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PEL-CODE.
